<%- include("partials/header") %>
<section class="hero"><div class="container hero-inner">
  <div>
    <p class="eyebrow">FITNESS PARA ROTINAS REAIS</p>
    <h1>Treine menos.<br><span>Evolua mais.</span></h1>
    <p class="lead">Responda 3 perguntas rápidas e descubra agora qual treino combina com o seu tempo e o seu objetivo.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="btn" href="/gerador-de-treino">DESCOBRIR MEU TREINO</a>
      <span class="micro-note"><svg class="icon-inline" viewBox="0 0 40 40" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="15" y="1" width="10" height="5" rx="2.5" fill="currentColor"/><circle cx="20" cy="22" r="15" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4"/><rect x="18.5" y="11" width="3" height="12" rx="1.5" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="20" y="20.5" width="8" height="3" rx="1.5" fill="currentColor"/></svg>Leva 30 segundos · sem cadastro</span>
    </div>
    <div class="pill-row">
      <a class="pill" href="/objetivos"><svg class="icon-inline" viewBox="0 0 40 40" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="20" cy="20" r="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="5"/><circle cx="20" cy="20" r="6" fill="currentColor"/></svg>Hipertrofia</a>
      <a class="pill" href="/objetivos"><svg class="icon-inline" viewBox="0 0 40 40" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="15" y="1" width="10" height="5" rx="2.5" fill="currentColor"/><circle cx="20" cy="22" r="15" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4"/><rect x="18.5" y="11" width="3" height="12" rx="1.5" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="20" y="20.5" width="8" height="3" rx="1.5" fill="currentColor"/></svg>Emagrecimento</a>
      <a class="pill" href="/objetivos"><svg class="icon-inline" viewBox="0 0 40 40" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="14" width="8" height="12" rx="3" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="10" y="17" width="5" height="6" rx="2" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="15" y="18.5" width="10" height="3" rx="1.5" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="25" y="17" width="5" height="6" rx="2" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="30" y="14" width="8" height="12" rx="3" fill="currentColor"/></svg>Força</a>
      <a class="pill" href="/treinos/hipertrofia-30-minutos"><svg class="icon-inline" viewBox="0 0 40 40" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="15" y="1" width="10" height="5" rx="2.5" fill="currentColor"/><circle cx="20" cy="22" r="15" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4"/><rect x="18.5" y="11" width="3" height="12" rx="1.5" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="20" y="20.5" width="8" height="3" rx="1.5" fill="currentColor"/></svg>30 min</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-card"><div class="timer">30</div><span>MINUTOS</span><p>O seu tempo pode ser curto. Seu treino não precisa ser ruim.</p></div>
</div></section>

<section class="section dark"><div class="container">
  <p class="section-tag reveal">COMO FUNCIONA</p>
  <h2 class="reveal">Em 3 passos você já sabe o que treinar hoje</h2>
  <div class="steps" style="margin-top:36px">
    <div class="step reveal"><div class="step-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="3" width="34" height="34" rx="9" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/><rect x="10" y="12" width="16" height="3.5" rx="1.75" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="10" y="19" width="20" height="3.5" rx="1.75" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="10" y="26" width="12" height="3.5" rx="1.75" fill="currentColor"/></svg></div><h3>1. Responda</h3><p>Objetivo, dias disponíveis, tempo por sessão e seu nível atual.</p></div>
    <div class="step reveal"><div class="step-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="15" y="1" width="10" height="6" rx="3" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="6" y="5" width="28" height="32" rx="6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M13 20l5 5 9-10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><h3>2. Receba</h3><p>Uma divisão de treino pronta, organizada por dia e por exercício.</p></div>
    <div class="step reveal"><div class="step-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="14" width="8" height="12" rx="3" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="10" y="17" width="5" height="6" rx="2" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="15" y="18.5" width="10" height="3" rx="1.5" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="25" y="17" width="5" height="6" rx="2" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="30" y="14" width="8" height="12" rx="3" fill="currentColor"/></svg></div><h3>3. Treine</h3><p>Siga séries, repetições e descanso — sem perder tempo pensando.</p></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="section"><div class="container">
  <div class="section-head reveal"><h2>Treinos em destaque</h2><a href="/treinos">Ver todos →</a></div>
  <div class="grid three reveal">
    <% workouts.slice(0,3).forEach(w => { %><a class="card workout-card" href="/treinos/<%= w.slug %>"><small><%= w.time %> · <%= w.level %></small><h3><%= w.title %></h3><p><%= w.objective %></p></a><% }) %>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="cta"><div class="container reveal"><h2>Não sabe por onde começar?</h2><p>Responda algumas perguntas e receba uma sugestão de divisão feita para você.</p><a class="btn light" href="/gerador-de-treino">MONTAR MEU TREINO</a></div></section>
<%- include("partials/footer") %>
